{# One runbook entry per demo of a section, in registry order, for its demo/README.md. #}
{% for demo in demos %}
### {{ demo.title }}

- **Tier**: {{ demo.tier.value }}{% if demo.tier.value == "optional" %}, cut first when the section runs late{% endif %}

- **Start it**: {{ demo.trigger.console }} in the console, or `{{ demo.trigger.make }}`
{% if demo.planted %}
- **Guaranteed by**: {% for id in demo.planted %}{% set item = planted[id] %}{{ item.name }}{% if item.kind.value in ("code_bug", "demo_aid") and id.isupper() %} (`{{ id }}`){% endif %}{{ "; " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
- **What appears**: {{ demo.guaranteed_moment | quoted }}
- **Expected live outcome**: {{ demo.expected_outcome | quoted }}
- **What can vary**: {{ demo.can_vary | join("; ") | quoted }}
- **Recovery**: `{{ demo.reset }}`, then the same trigger again
{% if not loop.last %}

{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
